+-----+          +-----+     /   \
|  a  |<--(X)----|  b  +--->|  =  |
+--+--+   a<-b   +-+---+     \___/
   |               |  ^        ^
   +------+   +----+  |        |
          |   |      (X) b<-t  |
       .--+---+--.    |       / \
        \  rem  /     |      / O \
         \_____/      |     +-----+
            |         |
           (X) t<-r   |
            |         |
            V         |
